    <string name="work_move_start_explain">Moves it to ready — the dispatcher picks it up on its next pass.</string>
    <string name="work_move_unblock_explain">Back to work as it is. The next run starts from where the last one stopped.</string>
    <string name="work_move_reassign_explain">Another profile runs it next. A running card is stopped first.</string>
    <string name="work_move_reclaim_explain">Ends the running worker and puts the card back in ready, so a fresh run takes it.</string>
    <string name="work_move_pause_explain">Parks it as waiting on you. The reason is what the next run reads when you unblock it.</string>
    <string name="work_move_done_explain">Closes it by hand. The note becomes its summary, and cards waiting on it can start.</string>
    <string name="work_move_archive_explain">Takes it off the board. A running worker is stopped.</string>
